```{=html}
<div class='sponsorsFooter'>
  <% for (const category of items) { %>
    <h2 id="<%- category.name.toLowerCase().replace(/\s+/g, '-') %>"><%- category.name %></h2>
    <ul>
      <% for (const item of category.items) { %>
        <li><a href="<%- item.href %>" target="_blank" class="sblogos__link"><img class="sblogos__img" src="<%- item.thumbnail %>" alt="<%= item.name %> logo" /></a></li>
      <% } %>
    </ul>
  <% } %>
</div>
```
